  "_about": "Curated per-language SUBJ4 surrogates for the 'Foreign Languages' MQ umbrella discipline. Our SYNTHETIC codes (NOT a CCN claim) — scheme = 'FL' + an intuitive 2-letter language tag (Sam, 2026-06-09). Splits the FLNG SUBJ4 collision so each language is a distinct course-identity subject, WHILE the MQ discipline stays 'Foreign Languages' (the authoritative MQ list has no per-language discipline). Used by kb/_fl_subj4_dryrun.py (and the future re-mint apply) to classify each FL M-ID / singleton to a language and re-key its SUBJ4. NOT a daily-cron artifact.",
